Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,\N(Arms down, head back, hold on!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.06,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me as I am
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.94,0:00:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,or you can watch me as I go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Never stood a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing more than an echo (echo)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,(echo)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.74,0:00:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruin all my plans
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me things I shouldn't know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,(know, know, know, know, know)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.24,0:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike me where I stand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll even open the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,(window, window)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuz I'm over it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm underwhelmed by the start of the fall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm oddly comforted by the thought
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,that if you blink twice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.66,0:00:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'll be gone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.62,0:00:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm over it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:00:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If nothing is right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.18,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,then everything's wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm hardly comforted by the thought
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.48,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm on thin ice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play along!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me out with the trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and don't dig up the past!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,With each tap of the glass
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,feel it crack, I feel it crack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Drag me down with the rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.92,0:01:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and don't dig up the scraps!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cover up my tracks 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.24,0:01:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.06,0:01:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,(back, back back, hold on!)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinking in the sand
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's out of my control
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.70,0:01:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.38,0:01:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't reach for my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't care till I let go
