Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.06,0:01:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,ME
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.36,0:01:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,GO!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuz I'm over it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My head's in the clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.78,0:01:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of regret weighing me down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.06,0:01:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm so scared I won't escape the sound
